Package: itpchronicity
Title: Integrated Variant x Expression Analysis of Pediatric ITP Chronicity
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("M V S Akhil", "Teja", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reproducible pipeline that audits public pediatric immune thrombocytopenia (ITP)
    transcriptomic cohorts, derives confounder-aware chronicity expression signals, links ITP GWAS
    susceptibility variants to genes by TWAS and colocalisation, intersects the two layers and
    benchmarks the resulting signatures against an expression-derived clinical baseline.
    This file only declares dependencies; the project is run with run_pipeline.R, not installed.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
